# Verified public-ask quotes; fictional market fixture, never funds/orders.
fold open
rotate landscape
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es fixture demo
expect FICTIONAL MARKET DEMO
expect 41%
expect YES 41¢
expect NO LIVE QUOTE
shot hunch-quotes-landscape
# Detail remains read-only and uses its own request pool.
tap Paper Cranes vs Ink Foxes
expect LIVE ASK
expect READ ONLY
shot hunch-quotes-detail
key BACK
rotate portrait
expect 41%
shot hunch-quotes-upright
# Quotes and unavailable state must survive returning from a scrolled list/detail.
tap COMPANIES 1
expect 41%
shot hunch-quotes-company
fold folded
expect 41%
shot hunch-quotes-cover
# [emu] Critic: scroll live public rows; verify real %/side cents, empty/old quotes stay unavailable, no layout clipping on long labels; confirm separate detail stays responsive.
